批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-4076d24c6c04efc0abc1","rensu-q-a9a2d7abf4ceba4acd22","rensu-q-39ae9e814e383b6faac6","rensu-q-69235cc8602e071795fd"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-4076d24c6c04efc0abc1","source_order":[16,88,43],"order":3414}],"persons":[{"id":"zhonghua-p0067","name":"范先","evidence":["zhonghua-q-1c92809c59c4ed26b372","rensu-q-3ad19941e0a5bfff867c","rensu-q-6ab1e9aaca52ff1df056","rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","rensu-q-731e737babc63ea9a444","rensu-q-b0f8cbec6f133fec76e5","rensu-q-39ae9e814e383b6faac6","rensu-q-b29d927d6d43065dbf63","rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-44642251fcd0aa6fdb46","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d158b35e0c99bd1badc0","layer":"original","quote":"使西征诸将马腾等，皆引兵会击晟等，破之。斩琰、固首，幹奔荆州","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":171,"end":201},{"id":"liusima-q-588f37f5363770e4b6f6","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-d158b35e0c99bd1badc0","layer":"original","quote":"河内张晟众万余人，无所属，寇崤、渑间〖4〗。河东卫固、弘农张琰，各起兵以应之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":119,"end":157},{"id":"rensu-q-39ae9e814e383b6faac6","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"固等与幹、晟共攻畿，不下；略诸县，无所得","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":91,"end":111},{"id":"rensu-q-3ad19941e0a5bfff867c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-18fc621e57fb0ca723bc","layer":"original","quote":"河东人卫固、范先外以请邑为名〖8〗，而内实与幹通谋","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":68,"end":93},{"id":"rensu-q-3c19c1ba0df2db66744c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-18fc621e57fb0ca723bc","layer":"original","quote":"于是追拜畿为河东太守","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":198,"end":208},{"id":"rensu-q-3e9e2be4b517ea19ca24","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-37919d79c597dc5a42a8","layer":"pei","quote":"先云：‘既欲为虎而恶食人肉，失所以为虎矣。今不杀，必为后患","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-75a1f9b90c35ca4848e9","start":10,"end":39},{"id":"rensu-q-4076d24c6c04efc0abc1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"畿知诸县附己，因出，单将数十骑，赴（张辟）〔坚壁〕拒守","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":70},{"id":"rensu-q-69235cc8602e071795fd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"其余党与，皆赦之，使复其居业","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":127,"end":141},{"id":"rensu-q-6ab1e9aaca52ff1df056","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"固等使兵数千人绝陕津〖1〗，畿至，不得渡","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"rensu-q-6fc011d0311d47d96ae9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖遣夏侯惇讨之，未至","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":32},{"id":"rensu-q-731e737babc63ea9a444","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-712df71ce4cf5c21e401","layer":"original","quote":"以固为都督，行丞事〖12〗，领功曹；将校吏兵三千余人，皆范先督之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":57,"end":89},{"id":"rensu-q-7541709a6f05cc964694","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"畿举动自若。于是固曰：“杀之无损，徒有恶名；且制之在我。”遂奉之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":252,"end":284},{"id":"rensu-q-839df869e15e162a3b26","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"范先欲杀畿以威众，﹝二﹞且观畿去就〖8〗，于门下斩杀主簿以下三十余人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":217,"end":251},{"id":"rensu-q-9c2058f75cb430f2cc42","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-712df71ce4cf5c21e401","layer":"original","quote":"固欲大发兵〖14〗；畿患之，说固曰：“夫欲为非常之事，不可动众心。今大发兵，众必扰；不如徐以赀募兵〖15〗。”固以为然，从之；遂为赀调发，数十日乃定；诸将贪，多应募而少遣兵","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":108,"end":194},{"id":"rensu-q-a1ab48fde1c8313d4c63","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-18fc621e57fb0ca723bc","layer":"original","quote":"太祖谓荀彧曰：“关西诸将，恃险与马〖9〗，征必为乱。张晟寇崤、渑间，南通刘表；固等因之，吾恐其为害深。河东被山带河，四邻多变，当今天下之要地也。君为我举萧何、寇恂以镇之〖10〗。”彧曰：“杜畿其人也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":94,"end":193},{"id":"rensu-q-a9a2d7abf4ceba4acd22","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"吏民多举城助畿者，比数十日，得四千余人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":90},{"id":"rensu-q-b05f74775f00a7994b85","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"或谓畿曰：“宜须大兵〖2〗。”畿曰：“河东有三万户，非皆欲为乱也。今兵迫之急，欲为善者无主，必惧而听于固；固等势专〖3〗，必以死战。讨之不胜，四邻应之，天下之变未息也；讨之而胜，是残一郡之民也。且固等未显绝王命〖4〗，外以请故君为名〖5〗，必不害新君〖6〗。吾单车直往，出其不意；固为人多计而无断，必伪受吾。吾得居郡一月，以计縻之，足矣","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":201},{"id":"rensu-q-b0f8cbec6f133fec76e5","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-712df71ce4cf5c21e401","layer":"original","quote":"又入喻固等曰：“人情顾家。诸将掾吏，可分遣休息，急缓召之不难〖17〗。”固等恶逆众心〖18〗，又从之。于是善人在外，阴为己援；恶人分散，各还其家：则众离矣","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":199,"end":276},{"id":"rensu-q-b29d927d6d43065dbf63","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"会大兵至，幹、晟败，固等伏诛","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":112,"end":126},{"id":"rensu-q-f3a6e24f1fd948be6c18","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dbcc0741c034bfee7b5b","layer":"original","quote":"遂诡道从郖津度","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":203,"end":210},{"id":"rensu-q-fbe9acf14b201e7901fa","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-14e81f2c7c0e488327c7","layer":"original","quote":"上党诸县杀长吏，弘农执郡守","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":34},{"id":"rensu-q-fc6fe04d4f00af441fdd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-18fc621e57fb0ca723bc","layer":"original","quote":"时河东太守王邑，被征","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":57,"end":67},{"id":"zhonghua-q-1c92809c59c4ed26b372","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6007847d1ec8e28149ac","layer":"pei","quote":"诏征河东太守王邑。邑以天下未定，心不愿征；而吏民亦恋邑，郡掾卫固及中郎将范先等，各诣繇求乞邑。而诏已拜杜畿为太守，畿已入界。繇不听先等，促邑交符。邑佩印绶，径从河北诣，自归。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7e5989b9f71152934b24","start":10,"end":97},{"id":"zhonghua-q-4bed0765b0b21f7a220b","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6ee93dddf14ade60e6ec","layer":"original","quote":"其后河东卫固作乱，与张晟、张琰及高幹等并为寇；繇又率诸将讨破之。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":228,"end":260}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
